## Overview

MediCore360 consolidates the core operational workflows of a healthcare organization into a single, secure platform:

- **Patient Records** — demographics, medical history, diagnoses, treatments
- **Appointments** — booking, rescheduling, cancellations, doctor availability
- **Billing** — invoices, insurance claims, payment tracking, refunds
- **Prescriptions** — issuance, dosage tracking, pharmacy integration
- **Compliance** — audit logs, regulatory reporting, exception tracking
- **Analytics** — KPI dashboards, trend analysis, operational insights

---

## Key Actors

| Role | Responsibilities |
|---|---|
| **Doctor** | Reviews patient records, issues diagnoses and prescriptions |
| **Nurse** | Manages vitals, care plans, and medication administration |
| **Receptionist** | Handles registration, appointments, and billing |
| **Patient** | Views own medical history, prescriptions, and appointments |
| **Compliance Officer** | Reviews audit logs and generates regulatory reports |
| **Admin** | Configures departments, user roles, and system settings |

---

## Modules

### 2.1 Identity & Access Management
- User provisioning and role assignment (RBAC)
- Secure login, session management, and password policies
- Immutable audit logs

**Entities:** `User`, `AuditLog`

---

### 2.2 Patient & Record Management
- Patient registration and demographic capture
- Medical history recording, updates, and archival
- Patient search and record retrieval

**Entities:** `Patient`, `Record`

---

### 2.3 Appointment & Scheduling
- Appointment booking, rescheduling, and cancellation workflows
- Doctor availability management and calendar integration

**Entities:** `Appointment`

---

### 2.4 Billing & Payment Management
- Invoice generation and payment tracking
- Insurance claim submission and refund workflows

**Entities:** `Invoice`, `Payment`

---

### 2.5 Prescription & Medication Management
- Prescription issuance by doctors
- Medication tracking, dosage schedules, and renewal workflows
- Pharmacy network integration

**Entities:** `Prescription`

---

### 2.6 Compliance & Audit Management
- Audit log review and exception tracking
- Regulatory reporting generation and compliance dashboards

**Entities:** `ComplianceReport`

---

### 2.7 Analytics & Reporting
- Operational dashboards for patient visits and billing
- KPI tracking: Patient Volume, Revenue, Claim Rejections
- Trend analysis and compliance reporting

**Entities:** `KPIReport`

---

### 2.8 Notifications & Alerts
- Real-time alerts for appointments, prescriptions, and compliance deadlines
- Configurable channels: in-app, email, SMS
- Escalation workflows and notification history

**Entities:** `Notification`

---

## Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
│         Frontend (SPA)              │
│     Angular / React Dashboards      │
└────────────────┬────────────────────┘
                 │ REST / HTTPS
┌────────────────▼────────────────────┐
│         Backend Services            │
│   Java Spring Boot / ASP.NET Core   │
└────────────────┬────────────────────┘
                 │
┌────────────────▼────────────────────┐
│         Relational Database         │
│   SQL Server / MySQL / PostgreSQL   │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
                 │
┌────────────────▼────────────────────┐
│         External Integrations       │
│  Insurance Systems · Pharmacy APIs  │
│       Regulatory Portals            │
└─────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Security:** TLS in transit · Encryption at rest · RBAC · Immutable audit logs · HIPAA/GDPR compliance

---

## Database Schema

| Table | Key Fields |
|---|---|
| `User` | UserID, Name, Role, Email, Phone |
| `AuditLog` | AuditID, UserID, Action, Timestamp |
| `Patient` | PatientID, Name, DOB, ContactInfo, MedicalHistory |
| `Record` | RecordID, PatientID, Diagnosis, Treatment, Date, Status |
| `Appointment` | AppointmentID, PatientID, DoctorID, Date, Time, Status |
| `Invoice` | InvoiceID, PatientID, Amount, Date, Status |
| `Payment` | PaymentID, InvoiceID, Amount, Date, Method, Status |
| `Prescription` | PrescriptionID, PatientID, DoctorID, Medication, Dosage, Date, Status |
| `ComplianceReport` | ReportID, Scope, Metrics, GeneratedDate |
| `KPIReport` | ReportID, Scope, Metrics, GeneratedDate |
| `Notification` | NotificationID, UserID, Message, Category, Status, CreatedDate |

---

## UI Dashboards

| Dashboard | Primary Users | Features |
|---|---|---|
| **Doctor Dashboard** | Doctor | Patient records, prescriptions, appointments |
| **Nurse Console** | Nurse | Vitals, care plans, medication schedules |
| **Receptionist Dashboard** | Receptionist | Registration, appointments, billing |
| **Compliance Dashboard** | Compliance Officer | Audit logs, regulatory reports |
| **Patient Portal** | Patient | Medical history, prescriptions, appointments |
| **Admin Console** | Admin | Departments, user roles, system config |

---

## Non-Functional Requirements

| Category | Requirement |
|---|---|
| **Performance** | Up to 30,000 concurrent users; appointment booking latency < 200 ms |
| **Security** | RBAC, TLS, encryption at rest, HIPAA compliance, immutable audit logs |
| **Scalability** | Horizontal scaling for patient and appointment services |
| **Availability** | 99.9% uptime target |
| **Maintainability** | Modular APIs, versioning, automated migrations, CI/CD pipelines |
| **Observability** | Centralized logs, metrics, and alerting |
| **Compliance** | Configurable retention policies, audit trails, regulatory reporting formats |

---

## Deployment Strategy

| Environment | Configuration |
|---|---|
| **Local / Dev** | Angular/React UI + Spring Boot/.NET backend + local RDBMS |
| **Staging** | Containerized services with synthetic patient and appointment data |
| **Production** | On-premise or hosted with API gateway and managed RDBMS with replicas |
| **High Availability** | Multi-server deployments, automated backups, disaster recovery playbooks |

---

## Phase 1 Scope

**Included:**
- Patient registration and record management
- Appointment scheduling
- Billing and payment workflows
- Operational dashboards

**Excluded (future phases):**
- AI-based diagnostics
- Telemedicine features
- Advanced mobile health integrations

---

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Options |
|---|---|
| **Frontend** | Angular · React |
| **Backend** | Java Spring Boot · ASP.NET Core |
| **Database** | SQL Server · MySQL · PostgreSQL |
| **Integration** | Insurance APIs · Pharmacy Networks · Regulatory Portals |
| **Security** | TLS · AES Encryption at Rest · RBAC · Audit Logging |

---

> **Compliance Notice:** MediCore360 is designed in adherence with HIPAA and GDPR standards. All patient data is encrypted, access is role-controlled, and all actions are logged in immutable audit trails.
